    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The memory of vulnerable families trapped by health care gaps burns bright in AugustinoMkongwa. It is this childhood resolve to serve that fuels a quiet revolution in the busy wards of Tumbi Regional Referral Hospital and across Tanzania. Augustino, an AKU-trained professional, is one of a new wave of leaders raising the standard of care and inspiring profound change.",
